00:01:10.657 --> 00:01:15.384
Introduction to Generative AI and Copilot Traditional AI

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:18.126
has been enhancing our lives for decades, from

00:01:18.151 --> 00:01:21.807
voice assistants like Siri and Alexa to recommendation

00:01:21.832 --> 00:01:23.712
systems on Netflix and Amazon.

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:27.760
Generative AI, or Gen AI, however, takes this a

00:01:27.785 --> 00:01:31.625
step further by crafting entirely new content,

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:35.482
whether writing a haiku, simplifying complex concepts,

00:01:35.507 --> 00:01:40.619
or analyzing data. Gen AI is truly a

00:01:40.644 --> 00:01:44.244
revolutionary frontier in artificial intelligence.

00:01:44.346 --> 00:01:47.867
Think of it as the smartest, most resourceful

00:01:47.892 --> 00:01:50.672
person you know, who is always ready to

00:01:50.697 --> 00:01:54.901
assist and teach you, without ever losing patience!

00:01:55.522 --> 00:01:58.066
Sounds too good to be true, doesn’t it?

00:01:58.091 --> 00:02:00.867
Well, like any human, it isn’t

00:02:00.892 --> 00:02:04.032
infallible and can definitely make mistakes.

00:02:04.769 --> 00:02:07.705
Gen AI relies on Large Language Models

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:11.354
(or LLMs) and foundation models.

00:02:11.379 --> 00:02:13.675
These are neural networks trained

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.424
on vast amounts of data.

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:19.150
These models predict and generate content word by

00:02:19.175 --> 00:02:22.773
word, making them capable of mimicking human creativity.

00:02:23.083 --> 00:02:26.755
While immensely capable, these systems are also responsibly

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:29.988
guided by human filters, so they’ll assist with

00:02:30.013 --> 00:02:32.793
productivity rather than, say, bank heists!

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:36.636
Enter Microsoft Copilot, a tool that

00:02:36.661 --> 00:02:38.945
brings Gen AI into the workplace.

00:02:39.658 --> 00:02:43.818
Copilot is integrated directly into Microsoft 365

00:02:43.843 --> 00:02:47.249
apps like Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Outlook, and

00:02:47.274 --> 00:02:51.586
Teams, turning these familiar tools into powerhouses

00:02:51.611 --> 00:02:53.903
of creativity and productivity.

00:02:54.447 --> 00:02:57.879
It works alongside you, helping you draft

00:02:57.904 --> 00:03:01.992
documents, create compelling presentations, analyze complex

00:03:02.017 --> 00:03:05.390
datasets, and even craft thoughtful emails.

00:03:05.932 --> 00:03:08.828
However, Copilot doesn’t stop there.

00:03:08.993 --> 00:03:11.858
Its Business Chat feature connects data across

00:03:11.883 --> 00:03:15.547
apps – like emails, calendars, and chats – allowing you

00:03:15.572 --> 00:03:18.748
to give natural language prompts such as, “Summarize

00:03:18.773 --> 00:03:21.335
today’s meetings and prepare a status update.”

00:03:21.884 --> 00:03:24.012
It retrieves relevant information and

00:03:24.037 --> 00:03:26.890
generates clear, actionable responses.

00:03:28.232 --> 00:03:32.320
Importantly, Copilot keeps you in control.

00:03:32.494 --> 00:03:35.278
It suggests ideas and content, but you

00:03:35.303 --> 00:03:39.164
decide what to keep, modify, or discard.

00:03:40.039 --> 00:03:42.250
In the subsequent sections, we’ll learn more

00:03:42.275 --> 00:03:44.563
about the capabilities of Copilot, and how

00:03:44.588 --> 00:03:47.062
it can help you streamline your work.

00:03:47.702 --> 00:03:50.758
Key Features of Copilot At the heart of

00:03:50.783 --> 00:03:55.976
Copilot’s capabilities lies Natural Language Processing (or NLP).

00:03:56.406 --> 00:04:01.190
This feature enables Copilot to understand and respond to human

00:04:01.215 --> 00:04:03.945
language as naturally as you or I would.

00:04:04.328 --> 00:04:06.703
You can try giving it intuitive commands like:

00:04:06.842 --> 00:04:10.354
“Summarize today’s meeting notes.” “Draft an email response

00:04:10.379 --> 00:04:14.139
based on the attached feedback.” or “Find trends

00:04:14.164 --> 00:04:16.352
in last quarter’s sales data.”

00:04:16.987 --> 00:04:20.687
Do this and sit back and watch as

00:04:20.712 --> 00:04:23.546
Copilot delivers results tailored to your needs.

00:04:23.696 --> 00:04:25.728
Its standout feature is its ability to

00:04:25.753 --> 00:04:30.225
create high-quality content efficiently. Integrating Copilot

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.706
into Microsoft 365 tools like Word, Excel,

00:04:33.731 --> 00:04:38.047
PowerPoint, Teams, and Outlook transforms them into

00:04:38.545 --> 00:04:42.085
AI-powered assistants that simplify workflows.

00:04:42.576 --> 00:04:45.624
Let’s delve deeper into this. With Word,

00:04:45.649 --> 00:04:48.085
Copilot can act as a writing assistant,

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:51.968
by helping draft documents, summarizing lengthy text,

00:04:51.993 --> 00:04:54.976
or rewriting sections for clarity and impact.

00:04:55.827 --> 00:04:57.459
Do you need to write an article,

00:04:57.484 --> 00:04:59.625
a blog post, or a proposal?

00:05:00.045 --> 00:05:03.257
Copilot can craft a first draft based on your prompts.

00:05:03.501 --> 00:05:06.629
For instance, you can ask it to “Create a

00:05:06.654 --> 00:05:09.968
two-page project proposal for a new marketing campaign,”

00:05:10.276 --> 00:05:13.937
and it generates a structured and professional draft.

00:05:14.532 --> 00:05:17.172
Also, when you’re tired of sifting through long

00:05:17.197 --> 00:05:20.351
reports or research papers, turn to Copilot.

00:05:21.003 --> 00:05:25.210
It condenses them into concise summaries, allowing

00:05:25.235 --> 00:05:27.250
you to focus on the key takeaways.

00:05:27.891 --> 00:05:30.507
It can also rewrite sentences or paragraphs

00:05:30.605 --> 00:05:33.625
to improve clarity, tone, or style.

00:05:34.084 --> 00:05:37.020
For example, you might ask, “Make this

00:05:37.045 --> 00:05:40.413
paragraph more conversational” or “Simplify this section

00:05:40.438 --> 00:05:42.726
for an audience unfamiliar with financial

00:05:42.751 --> 00:05:45.273
jargon.” This is particularly useful for

00:05:45.298 --> 00:05:48.460
editing emails, reports, or complex instructions.

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:50.492
Now, let’s look at how Copilot

00:05:50.517 --> 00:05:53.046
can simplify Excel for you.

00:05:53.953 --> 00:05:55.961
Copilot can analyze datasets

00:05:55.986 --> 00:05:58.114
to uncover insights and trends.

00:05:58.139 --> 00:06:01.059
For example, a prompt like “Identify the

00:06:01.084 --> 00:06:03.468
top-performing regions for sales in Q3”

00:06:03.493 --> 00:06:07.585
generates clear insights, complete with visualizations.

00:06:07.998 --> 00:06:09.134
And if you’re struggling with

00:06:09.159 --> 00:06:10.976
formulas, look no further,

00:06:11.382 --> 00:06:13.140
Copilot can suggest the appropriate

00:06:13.165 --> 00:06:14.734
functions based on your needs.

00:06:14.916 --> 00:06:17.476
You can say, “Calculate the year-over-

00:06:17.501 --> 00:06:19.171
year growth for these sales figures,” and

00:06:19.196 --> 00:06:21.742
it will apply the correct formula.

00:06:22.098 --> 00:06:24.687
And finally, save time by automating

00:06:24.712 --> 00:06:27.792
tasks like formatting tables, sorting data,

00:06:27.817 --> 00:06:29.765
or cleaning up inconsistencies.

00:06:30.249 --> 00:06:32.929
A simple command such as “Format this data for

00:06:32.954 --> 00:06:38.794
presentation” ensures a polished result without manual adjustments. On

00:06:38.819 --> 00:06:43.173
Powerpoint, Copilot can do so many things, from helping

00:06:43.198 --> 00:06:45.502
you choose the right themes and designs to align

00:06:45.527 --> 00:06:49.039
with your presentation’s tone, to transforming text outlines or

00:06:49.064 --> 00:06:52.000
bullet points into well-structured slides.

00:06:52.404 --> 00:06:55.452
For instance, “Create a three-slide presentation

00:06:55.477 --> 00:06:58.101
summarizing this document” results in

00:06:58.126 --> 00:07:00.671
organized, visually appealing slides.

00:07:00.933 --> 00:07:03.813
It can also generate charts, diagrams,

00:07:03.838 --> 00:07:07.138
or graphics to illustrate complex ideas.

00:07:08.193 --> 00:07:10.223
You can try a prompt like, “Add a

00:07:10.248 --> 00:07:12.872
pie chart to represent the budget breakdown” to

00:07:12.897 --> 00:07:16.054
obtain complex data in a pleasing visual form.

00:07:16.981 --> 00:07:19.237
In collaboration-focused tools like

00:07:19.262 --> 00:07:23.222
Microsoft Teams, Copilot enhances communication

00:07:23.247 --> 00:07:26.320
and project management. During meetings,

00:07:26.345 --> 00:07:29.425
Copilot can transcribe discussions, generate action

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:32.482
items, and even summarize meeting highlights

00:07:32.507 --> 00:07:34.195
for absent team members.

00:07:34.625 --> 00:07:37.457
The Business Chat feature connects data across

00:07:37.482 --> 00:07:41.148
Microsoft 365 apps to enable advanced workflows.

00:07:41.538 --> 00:07:44.250
For example, you can ask, “Send a summary of

00:07:44.275 --> 00:07:47.035
today’s meeting to the sales team with key takeaways,”

00:07:47.144 --> 00:07:51.280
and it pulls information from meeting notes, emails, and

00:07:51.305 --> 00:07:53.601
chat history to craft the message.

00:07:53.929 --> 00:07:55.992
Copilot integrates across apps,

00:07:56.017 --> 00:07:57.648
enabling fluid transitions.

00:07:57.857 --> 00:08:00.726
For instance, data visualized in Excel can be

00:08:00.751 --> 00:08:03.767
exported into a PowerPoint slide with a simple command

00:08:03.792 --> 00:08:06.046
like “Add this chart to my presentation.”

00:08:06.546 --> 00:08:10.273
The seamless integration of Copilot across workplace tools

00:08:10.298 --> 00:08:13.410
ensures tasks that once required multiple steps and

00:08:13.435 --> 00:08:17.625
tools are now completed effortlessly in one system.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:23.132
Best Practices for Using Copilot To fully harness

00:08:23.157 --> 00:08:26.941
the potential of Microsoft 365 Copilot, users should

00:08:26.966 --> 00:08:31.992
adopt best practices that ensure effective, secure, and

00:08:32.017 --> 00:08:34.281
ethical interactions with the AI.

00:08:34.932 --> 00:08:38.656
The quality of Copilot’s output depends heavily on the

00:08:38.681 --> 00:08:42.984
clarity and structure of your prompts. so Be Specific:

00:08:43.524 --> 00:08:45.828
The more detailed your prompt, the better

00:08:45.853 --> 00:08:47.531
Copilot can meet your needs.

00:08:48.142 --> 00:08:51.566
For example, instead of saying, “Explain this

00:08:51.591 --> 00:08:54.507
document,” a more effective prompt would be,

00:08:54.726 --> 00:08:58.187
“Summarize this technical document in three bullet

00:08:58.212 --> 00:09:01.250
points suitable for a non-technical audience.”

00:09:02.116 --> 00:09:07.382
Iterate and Refine: Copilot thrives on user feedback.

00:09:07.662 --> 00:09:10.906
If the response isn’t quite right, rephrase

00:09:10.931 --> 00:09:13.070
or add more details to your prompt.

00:09:13.317 --> 00:09:16.445
For instance, if you’re unsatisfied with a report

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:19.367
draft, you can guide Copilot with commands like,

00:09:19.573 --> 00:09:23.132
“Rewrite this section to emphasize cost efficiency.”

00:09:23.604 --> 00:09:28.724
Experiment with Creativity: Beyond structured tasks,

00:09:28.833 --> 00:09:30.875
Copilot is a powerful tool for

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:33.548
brainstorming and generating innovative ideas.

00:09:33.709 --> 00:09:36.781
Ask it for alternative headlines, creative slide

00:09:36.806 --> 00:09:39.312
titles, or new ways to present data.

00:09:39.772 --> 00:09:41.596
As with any AI tool,

00:09:41.621 --> 00:09:44.304
maintaining data privacy is paramount.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:48.138
Use Copilot within trusted, organization-approved platforms

00:09:48.163 --> 00:09:51.203
to ensure compliance with data security protocols.

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:55.362
Avoid sharing unnecessary personal or sensitive information

00:09:55.387 --> 00:09:58.155
and ensure that any shared data is

00:09:58.180 --> 00:10:00.920
encrypted and anonymized when possible.

00:10:01.769 --> 00:10:05.742
For example, instead of uploading raw customer details,

00:10:06.201 --> 00:10:09.621
work with summarized or generalized datasets.

00:10:10.131 --> 00:10:12.827
Familiarize yourself with how Copilot accesses

00:10:12.852 --> 00:10:16.414
your organization's data (emails, documents, etc.),

00:10:16.467 --> 00:10:17.490
ensuring it’s in line with

00:10:17.515 --> 00:10:19.250
your company’s privacy policies.

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:23.596
And most importantly, always review and verify

00:10:23.621 --> 00:10:26.173
AI outputs to ensure they align with

00:10:26.198 --> 00:10:28.539
your intentions and ethical standards.

00:10:29.293 --> 00:10:31.525
AI models can inadvertently reflect

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:33.101
biases in their training data.

00:10:33.587 --> 00:10:37.355
Be vigilant in identifying and correcting any biases

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:41.023
in Copilot’s responses, especially when generating content

00:10:41.048 --> 00:10:43.934
or making decisions that could impact others.

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:48.006
And when presenting Copilot-generated outputs to

00:10:48.031 --> 00:10:50.554
stakeholders, be clear about its role.

00:10:51.141 --> 00:10:54.898
Transparency builds trust and sets realistic

00:10:54.923 --> 00:10:58.531
expectations about AI’s capabilities and limitations.

00:10:59.408 --> 00:11:01.906
By following these practices, users can

00:11:01.931 --> 00:11:05.603
maximize Copilot’s potential while upholding privacy,

00:11:05.628 --> 00:11:07.690
security, and responsibility.

00:11:08.332 --> 00:11:09.803
Congratulations!

00:11:09.828 --> 00:11:12.004
You completed the course: Boosting

00:11:12.029 --> 00:11:14.625
Efficiency With Microsoft Copilot

