00:11:18.544 --> 00:11:23.924
on Large Language Models (or LLMs) and foundation models.

00:11:24.521 --> 00:11:28.078
These are neural networks trained on vast amounts of data

00:11:28.103 --> 00:11:32.023
and can predict and generate content word by word.

00:11:32.692 --> 00:11:36.812
You Learned that Microsoft 365 Copilot is integrated

00:11:36.837 --> 00:11:41.589
directly into Microsoft 365 apps like Word, Excel,

00:11:41.614 --> 00:11:46.198
PowerPoint, Outlook, and Teams, turning these tools into

00:11:46.223 --> 00:11:49.147
powerhouses of creativity and productivity.

00:11:49.867 --> 00:11:54.019
You also learned the quality of Copilot's output depends

00:11:54.044 --> 00:11:58.062
heavily on the clarity and structure of its prompts.

00:11:58.194 --> 00:12:00.372
And finally, you learned that

00:12:00.397 --> 00:12:03.382
maintaining data privacy is paramount.

00:12:03.891 --> 00:12:06.179
Ensure Copilot is integrated into

00:12:06.204 --> 00:12:08.664
secure, organization-approved environments.

00:12:09.279 --> 00:12:12.890
Always review and verify AI outputs to ensure

00:12:12.915 --> 00:12:15.979
they align with your intentions and ethical standards.